      "hizbQuarter": 65,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1049,
      "text": "Then We changed their adversity into prosperity until they flourished and said, “Our forefathers were also afflicted with hardship and ease.” Then We seized them by surprise while they were unaware.",
